Explanation: Developer bisa membangun application-specific blockchains tanpa konsensus dari nol; ratusan chains dibangun: Osmosis, Juno, Evmos, Neutron, Celestia, Noble, Stride; Ignite CLI (Starport) mempermudah scaffolding【Phase 3 — History SDK Releases】【Phase 4 — Technology SDK Architecture】【Phase 7 — Ecosystem SDK Projects】.
