Confidence: HIGH

Factor 2: Inflation Tinggi (7-20%) Menyebabkan Dilution Non-Stakers Tanpa Fee Burn Mechanism
Explanation: Dynamic inflation targeting 67% bonded ratio; non-stakers (liquid holders, DeFi users) diluted ~7-20%/tahun; tidak ada native burn mechanism pada protocol level; fee tidak di-burn tapi didistribusikan ke validator/delegator/community pool; fee burn discussion masih ongoing 2024【Phase 6 — Inflation Mechanism】【Phase 6 — Token Burn Mechanism】【Phase 3 — EV-FEE-BURN-2024】【Phase 9 — Trade-off 2】.
Evidence: Inflation params konstan sejak genesis; bonded ratio ~65%; ATOM 2.0 proposal fee capture untuk offset inflation; Prop 848/891 discussion 2024 belum keputusan final【Phase 6 — Token Inflation】【Phase 3 — EV-ATOM2-2022】【Phase 3 — EV-FEE-BURN-2024】.
