Decision Framework

Step 1: Observe — Riset & Signaling Panjang (6-18 Bulan) Via Whitepaper, Forum Discussion, Testnet
Explanation: Major upgrades didahului whitepaper/discussion 6-18 bulan; testnet panjang; validator coordination; Stargate discussed 2019 launched 2021; ICS discussed 2021 (ATOM 2.0) launched 2023; CometBFT discussed 2022 v1.0 2023【Phase 3 — History Upgrade Timeline】【Phase 4 — Technology Upgrade Process】【Phase 9 — Pola 1 Evolution】.
Evidence: Stargate testnet bulan sebelum mainnet; ICS v1 testnet dengan Neutrality/Stride; CometBFT testnet months sebelum v1.0; validator coordination via Discord/forum【Phase 3 — History Testnet Events】【Phase 4 — Technology Upgrade Process】【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Validator Coordination】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 History, Phase 4 Technology, Phase 7 Ecosystem, Phase 9 Behavioral.
Confidence: HIGH

Step 2: Evaluate — Community Feedback & Off-Chain Signaling (Forum, Discord, Validator Calls, Text Proposals)
Explanation: Kontroversial proposals (ATOM 2.0, fee burn, community pool spending besar) → diskusi forum lama → signaling proposal (text proposal) → formal proposal; veto power (NoWithVeto 33.4%) digunakan untuk spam/attack proposals【Phase 3 — EV-ATOM2-2022】【Phase 3 — EV-FEE-BURN-2024】【Phase 9 — Pola 4 Governance】.
Evidence: ATOM 2.0 discussion 2022; fee burn discussion 2024; community pool spend debates; NoWithVeto usage di Mintscan【Phase 3 — History Governance】【Phase 6 — Token Governance】【Phase 8 — Market Governance Activity】.
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 History, Phase 6 Token, Phase 8 Market, Phase 9 Behavioral.
Confidence: HIGH

Step 3: Fund — ICF Grants Ke Core Infrastructure (CosmWasm, IBC Relayers, Wallets, SDK Tooling) Sebelum Application Layer
Explanation: ICF grants konsisten ke core infrastructure: CosmWasm (2019+), IBC relayers (2021+), Keplr/Leap wallets (2020+), Ignite CLI (2021+); tidak ke application-layer projects kecuali infrastructure-enabling; grants ~$2-5M/tahun【Phase 5 — Financial Grants】【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Infrastructure】【Phase 9 — Pola 3 Ekosistem】.
