Step 4: Develop — Modular Development: Setiap Layer (Consensus, Networking, Application) Dikembangkan & Diupgrade Independennya
Explanation: Cosmos SDK core tetap Go; smart contract execution via CosmWasm (Rust/WASM) sebagai module; CometBFT konsensus engine terpisah; IBC, CosmWasm, SDK modules diupgrade via governance proposals terpisah【Phase 4 — Technology Architecture】【Phase 4 — Technology CosmWasm】【Phase 3 — EV-COMETBFT-2023】【Phase 9 — Pola 1, Pola 3 Behavioral】.
Evidence: CosmWasm integrated Stargate 2021; Neutron launch 2023 sebagai CosmWasm hub; Juno sebagai CosmWasm playground; ICF grants ke CosmWasm tooling【Phase 4 — Technology CosmWasm】【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Major Apps】【Phase 5 — Financial Grants】.
