Step 5: Launch — Testnet Panjang + Validator Coordination + Gradual Mainnet Rollout (ICS v1/v2, Stargate, CometBFT)
Explanation: Semua major upgrade diuji di testnet (Theta testnet, Rho testnet) dan deploy ke consumer chains/ICF chains sebelum mainnet; Gaia release candidate dikaji validator set; ICS v1 testnet dengan Neutrality/Stride【Phase 3 — History Testnet Events】【Phase 4 — Technology Upgrade Process】【Phase 7 — Ecosystem Validator Coordination】【Phase 9 — Pola 2 Behavioral】.
